{
  "id": "E421",
  "title": "“You Think”",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-04-18",
  "synopsis": "A popular internet slang in China to help you be “bossy”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50421/767b5e4c29525a6a45b14adbcec17468b8f5321f.mp3?1586590827",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我不要“你觉得”\n\n小乐：星期六我们去看电影吧？\n保罗：好啊。最近有一个很火的动作片。我们就看它吧。\n小乐：我们还是去看这个恐怖片吧，网上有很多人都说好。\n保罗：但是我觉得动作片更有意思啊。\n小乐：我不要“你觉得”，我要“我觉得”。我觉得恐怖片更好看，就看这个了。",
    "traditional": "我不要“你覺得”\n\n小樂：星期六我們去看電影吧？\n保羅：好啊。最近有一個很火的動作片。我們就看它吧。\n小樂：我們還是去看這個恐怖片吧，網上有很多人都說好。\n保羅：但是我覺得動作片更有意思啊。\n小樂：我不要“你覺得”，我要“我覺得”。我覺得恐怖片更好看，就看這個了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I don’t want “You think”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：星期六我们去看电影吧？",
      "traditional": "小樂：星期六我們去看電影吧？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè xīng qī liù wǒ men qù kàn diàn yǐng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: How about we go see a movie on Saturday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：好啊。最近有一个很火的动作片。我们就看它吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好啊。最近有一個很火的動作片。我們就看它吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo a zuì jìn yǒu yí ge hěn huǒ de dòng zuò piàn wǒ men jiù kàn tā ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Sure. There is an action movie that has been very popular recently. Let’s go watch it."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：我们还是去看这个恐怖片吧，网上有很多人都说好。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我們還是去看這個恐怖片吧，網上有很多人都說好。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ men hái shi qù kàn zhè ge kǒng bù piàn ba wǎng shang yǒu hěn duō rén dōu shuō hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Let’s nevertheless go see this horror movie. A lot of people online said it’s good."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：但是我觉得动作片更有意思啊。",
      "traditional": "保羅：但是我覺得動作片更有意思啊。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó dàn shì wǒ jué de dòng zuò piàn gèng yǒu yì si a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: But I think that an action movie is more interesting."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：我不要“你觉得”，我要“我觉得”。我觉得恐怖片更好看，就看这个了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我不要“你覺得”，我要“我覺得”。我覺得恐怖片更好看，就看這個了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ bú yào nǐ jué de wǒ yào wǒ jué de wǒ jué de kǒng bù piàn gèng hǎo kàn jiù kàn zhè ge le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I don’t want “you think”, I want “I think”. I think the horror movie is better, so let’s watch this one."
    }
  ],
